cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PhotonCount"
abstract: "Photon-counting receiver chain for photon-starved optical links — Poisson and Webb detection statistics, PPM slot statistics, paralyzable and non-paralyzable dead time and afterpulsing, soft-decision metrics for PPM over the Poisson channel, Poisson capacity bounds; hardware abstraction layer with simulated and device backends, simulation and dry-run modes, executable deployment and recovery checks, benchmark harness; learned dead-time and afterpulsing correction against the closed-form corrections with an uncertainty interval."
type: software
authors:
